Two setting groups only:
  SSH  : minutes, quota GB, IP limit
  XRAY : minutes, quota GB, IP limit  (VMess/VLESS/Trojan/Shadowsocks)

Trial accounts are created with the normal panel scripts, then registered in
/etc/kyt/trial/state so kyt-trial-expire can delete them after the minute
deadline or when the quota is exhausted.
"""

